#!/bin/sh
# Installer (Calamares) im Biblix-Look. Alles andere am Aussehen kommt aus dem Paket
# biblix-design und laesst sich per Update aendern; der Installer betrifft nur neue Installationen.
set -e
# ISO-Version (schreibt build.sh nach /etc/biblix-iso)
ISO_VERSION=2.0
[ -r /etc/biblix-iso ] && . /etc/biblix-iso
BR=/usr/share/biblix/branding
png() { rsvg-convert -w "$2" -h "$3" -o "$4" "$1"; }

if [ -d /etc/calamares/branding/debian ]; then
    CB=/etc/calamares/branding/biblix
    rm -rf $CB
    cp -a /etc/calamares/branding/debian $CB
    for key in productName shortProductName bootloaderEntryName; do
        sed -i "s|^\( *$key: *\).*|\1Biblix|" $CB/branding.desc
    done
    for key in version shortVersion; do
        sed -i "s|^\( *$key: *\).*|\1\"$ISO_VERSION\"|" $CB/branding.desc
    done
    for key in versionedName shortVersionedName; do
        sed -i "s|^\( *$key: *\).*|\1\"Biblix $ISO_VERSION\"|" $CB/branding.desc
    done
    sed -i "s|^componentName:.*|componentName: biblix|" $CB/branding.desc
    for key in productLogo productIcon; do
        img=$(sed -n "s|^ *$key: *\"\{0,1\}\([^\"]*\)\"\{0,1\} *$|\1|p" $CB/branding.desc)
        [ -n "$img" ] && png $BR/biblix-logo.svg 256 256 "$CB/$img"
    done
    # Diashow und Farben im Bibi-Tech-Look (show.qml kommt aus includes.chroot)
    if [ -f /usr/share/biblix/branding/calamares/show.qml ]; then
        cp /usr/share/biblix/branding/calamares/show.qml $CB/show.qml
    fi
    sed -i -e 's|^\( *SidebarBackground: *\).*|\1"#1a2029"|' \
           -e 's|^\( *SidebarText: *\).*|\1"#e8ecf2"|' \
           -e 's|^\( *SidebarTextCurrent: *\).*|\1"#ffffff"|' \
           -e 's|^\( *SidebarBackgroundCurrent: *\).*|\1"#378add"|' $CB/branding.desc
    sed -i -e 's|^\( *productUrl: *\).*|\1https://github.com/Bobbsinator/biblix|' \
           -e 's|^\( *supportUrl: *\).*|\1https://github.com/Bobbsinator/biblix|' \
           -e 's|^\( *knownIssuesUrl: *\).*|\1https://github.com/Bobbsinator/biblix/issues|' $CB/branding.desc
    sed -i "s|^branding:.*|branding: biblix|" /etc/calamares/settings.conf
fi

# Installer-Starter umbenennen
for f in /usr/share/applications/calamares*.desktop /usr/share/applications/install-debian.desktop; do
    [ -f "$f" ] || continue
    sed -i -e 's/^Name=.*/Name=Biblix installieren/' -e 's/^Name\[de\]=.*/Name[de]=Biblix installieren/' \
           -e 's/^Comment=.*/Comment=VIEL ERFOLG./' -e 's/^Icon=.*/Icon=biblix/' "$f"
done
